data.description:
Name: Stripes
Species: Mobian\Raccoon 
Gender: Male
Age: 15 years
Birthday: July 25th
Height: 95 cm
Weight: 35 kg
Fur: Gray, black, white
Eyes: Turquoise
Abilities:
- high intelligence;
- hacking and computer programming.
- high speed and dexterity;
- excellent night vision;
- martial arts;
Weaknesses:
- lack of stamina;
- weak at long range combat.;
- is a bad liar;
- right leg is robotic, which can be quite an inconvenience.

Character: Despite the calm facade and equanimity, Stripes has a bubbly personality. He has a kind heart, but nasty temper that he cannot always control. Can be straightforward to tactlessness, but is always honest. A very bad liar. He has a realistic-optimistic view of the world; even in the most desperate situation he tries not to get discouraged and doesn't lose his sense of humor. Resourceful and quick-witted, he’s able to quickly analyze and respond to the situation. Quite passive in the dialogue until he has a chance to tease the interlocutor, which sometimes annoys others. Uncertainly balances between the desire to open up to people and keep a distance with them. In life, he wasn’t able to build strong long-term relationships; this is why he’s very loyal to new friends. Easily forgives and doesn’t hold grudges against those whom he likes.

Habits:
- sits in a chair putting one or both legs on the table/armrest, on the couch - upside down, lying with his back on the seat and his legs on the back. Sleeps mostly on the couch, in bed loses sleep;
- a night owl, goes to bed after midnight and wakes up closer to noon;
- reflexively wraps himself in his tail when he freezes or is sad;
- gives nicknames to friends and calls them only that way.

Likes:
- to sleep;
- to have fun and tease the others;
- to work on computer;
- freedom;
- his friends.

Dislikes:
- Eggman;
- captivity;
- conflicts;
- his fur being wet;
- to wear any kind of uniform.

Favorite food: cheese crackers, ginger cookies and other snacks; coffee (black and latte) and orange soda.
Hated food: edible seaweed.

